\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The rotation $T_t$ continuously transforms the synthetic lines $l^{h(0)}_{ij}$ towards the observed lines $l^{h}_{ij}$ by applying a rotation of an angle $t\alpha $ around the intersection point $O$. At the end of the homotopy, $T_t$ transforms the synthetic parameters $\mathcal  {L}_0$ of our problem to the observed parameters $\mathcal  {L}_1$.}}{6}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
